# Renders written by the offline audit tools into whatever directory they are run from.
#
# panelrender and rackrender take an output PREFIX as their first argument and default to writing
# beside the working directory, so running one from the top of the tree drops a dozen PNGs into it.
# They are build output in the same sense an object file is: regenerated by the gate on every run,
# different after any layout change, and reviewed by looking at them rather than by diffing them.
# Eleven of them were tracked for a while and every UI change then showed up as a binary diff
# nobody could read.
#
# Anchored to the top level, so the real art under products/*/resources/ and products/*/gui/ is
# untouched. Each product carries the same rule for its own directory.
/*.png

